WEBVTT

01:30.370 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.330 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 5]

01:39.509 --> 01:40.400
Grandfather,

01:40.870 --> 01:42.600
please teach me how to make ink.

02:04.590 --> 02:05.510
Zhen,

02:07.480 --> 02:09.190
I have sworn an oath that,

02:10.120 --> 02:11.030
from now on,

02:12.240 --> 02:14.900
I'll never involve myself
in ink-making again.

02:14.910 --> 02:16.630
Just give up on this.

02:17.400 --> 02:19.280
You only swore never to make ink,

02:19.630 --> 02:22.160
but you didn't say
you wouldn't teach others.

02:25.960 --> 02:27.190
No means no.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.890
There's no use saying more.

02:34.000 --> 02:34.800
Zhen,

02:35.430 --> 02:37.470
don't be stubborn with your grandfather.

02:37.470 --> 02:39.520
Our family has suffered misfortunes
all these years,

02:39.520 --> 02:40.960
all because of this ink.

02:42.520 --> 02:44.320
Your father died because of ink.

02:44.520 --> 02:46.840
Your grandfather suffered
worse than death because of it.

02:46.840 --> 02:48.630
It also ruined the marriages

02:48.630 --> 02:50.630
and future of you and your brother.

02:50.840 --> 02:53.240
Hasn't ink harmed our family enough?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.360
That's right.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.470
Mother,

03:03.910 --> 03:05.640
our family has hit rock bottom,

03:05.710 --> 03:07.470
all because of ink.

03:08.150 --> 03:09.030
Therefore,

03:09.840 --> 03:11.240
I must earn

03:11.520 --> 03:13.560
it all back through ink.

03:13.590 --> 03:14.520
Earn it all back?

03:15.360 --> 03:16.800
What do you have to earn it back?

03:16.800 --> 03:18.240
How can you do it?

03:19.800 --> 03:20.680
I suggest you

03:20.800 --> 03:22.240
give up this idea now.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.170
I will absolutely not agree to it!

03:30.430 --> 03:32.520
I want to live with my head held high!

03:33.800 --> 03:35.060
As for the ink-making,

03:35.310 --> 03:36.750
I have made up my mind!

03:37.630 --> 03:39.400
Even if Grandfather won't teach me,

03:39.400 --> 03:41.460
I will go to other workshops to learn.

03:41.470 --> 03:43.710
I must make a mark out there!

03:55.840 --> 03:56.630
Zhen.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.329
Are you sure this will work?

03:59.840 --> 04:00.710
It will.

04:00.750 --> 04:01.520
Zhengliang, don't worry.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.400
I've asked around.

04:02.400 --> 04:04.030
Every ink workshop is hiring new recruits.

04:04.030 --> 04:05.560
I should try them one by one.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.710
Which ink workshop do you plan to go to?

04:09.000 --> 04:10.190
Third Grandfather's place, of course.

04:10.190 --> 04:11.590
The Chen's Ink Workshop.

04:11.910 --> 04:14.000
What if you get discovered?

04:14.280 --> 04:15.030
It's fine.

04:15.210 --> 04:15.940
I'll go first

04:15.950 --> 04:16.829
and deal with it if I'm discovered.

04:16.829 --> 04:17.510
Besides,

04:17.600 --> 04:18.920
even if Third Grandfather discovers me,

04:18.920 --> 04:20.380
he can't do anything to me.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.480
Remember,

04:22.600 --> 04:23.720
you must help me hide this from Mother

04:23.720 --> 04:24.980
and never let her know.

04:25.310 --> 04:26.720
If Mother finds out about it,

04:26.720 --> 04:28.650
she will definitely tear me apart.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.390
Zhen,

04:31.430 --> 04:33.890
this is a new set of clothes
Ms. Du made for me.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.430
I haven't even worn them yet.

04:35.430 --> 04:36.480
Don't ruin them.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.159
I see.

04:37.159 --> 04:38.159
Zhengliang, remember

04:38.159 --> 04:39.420
to keep it from Mother.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.390
I'm leaving.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.680
Be careful!

04:46.280 --> 04:50.630
[Chen's Ink Workshop]

04:56.830 --> 04:58.070
Starting today,

04:58.240 --> 04:59.750
you will pound ink here.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.600
No running around.

05:01.750 --> 05:03.630
If you break the rules, you leave.

05:04.480 --> 05:05.310
You go pound at the back.

05:05.310 --> 05:05.800
Okay.

05:06.750 --> 05:07.560
You

05:07.750 --> 05:09.150
use this pestle to pound.

05:09.680 --> 05:10.600
You three,

05:10.920 --> 05:12.050
go pound over there.

05:15.510 --> 05:16.310
Master,

05:16.310 --> 05:18.070
how many times do we have to pound this?

05:18.070 --> 05:20.330
A hundred thousand times for light glue.

05:20.750 --> 05:22.080
Just focus on pounding.

05:22.240 --> 05:24.480
Someone will come to check it later.

05:25.040 --> 05:25.870
Lin!

05:26.240 --> 05:27.190
Bring the ink blocks

05:27.190 --> 05:28.390
and distribute them.

05:59.460 --> 06:01.200
[Win Laurels in the Golden Palace]

06:23.800 --> 06:24.720
Third Master,

06:25.000 --> 06:27.400
we recently hired a new worker
to pound ink.

06:27.830 --> 06:29.000
But the more I look at her,

06:29.000 --> 06:32.260
the more she looks like
Eighth Master Li's granddaughter.

06:34.190 --> 06:35.000
Where is she?

06:36.430 --> 06:37.690
That's her over there.

06:37.830 --> 06:39.190
She works pretty hard

06:39.310 --> 06:40.970
and looks sharp-witted, too.

06:41.120 --> 06:41.950
Should we

06:42.220 --> 06:46.890
[Third Master Chen, Chen Jiru,
Manager of Chen Ink]

06:42.510 --> 06:43.680
keep her or not?

06:45.240 --> 06:46.190
The ink workshop recruits

06:46.190 --> 06:47.830
and keeps anyone who can work.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.630
Okay.

06:49.310 --> 06:51.630
Send her to the smoke shed to burn soot.

07:01.190 --> 07:02.040
Jinshui,

07:02.310 --> 07:03.510
we two brothers

07:04.510 --> 07:06.970
haven't had a drink together
for a long time.

07:08.070 --> 07:08.680
Cheers.

07:11.240 --> 07:13.500
You invited me for a drink
out of the blue.

07:14.120 --> 07:14.830
Tell me.

07:15.240 --> 07:16.300
What's the matter?

07:23.480 --> 07:25.920
I was afraid you'd be bored
not making ink,

07:26.120 --> 07:27.750
so I came to chat with you.

07:33.000 --> 07:33.870
Come on, eat up.

07:33.870 --> 07:34.680
Come on.

07:45.480 --> 07:47.159
What has your granddaughter, Zhen,

07:47.159 --> 07:48.600
been busy with lately?

07:49.750 --> 07:51.950
She's working at Mr. Shui's food stall.

07:52.159 --> 07:53.159
She goes out early

07:53.600 --> 07:55.260
and comes back late every day.

07:58.310 --> 07:59.480
You saw it?

08:01.070 --> 08:02.160
What do you mean?

08:12.270 --> 08:14.130
Just say whatever you want to say.

08:17.240 --> 08:17.950
Jinshui.

08:19.560 --> 08:21.160
I have something to tell you.

08:25.390 --> 08:27.050
You can't get mad when I say it.

08:28.510 --> 08:30.110
If you do, I just won't say it.

08:30.870 --> 08:32.000
Then I won't get mad.

08:32.110 --> 08:32.909
Go ahead.

08:35.030 --> 08:36.320
Zhen...

08:37.789 --> 08:38.720
She is now

08:39.870 --> 08:41.400
working in my ink workshop.

08:46.030 --> 08:48.000
Then why didn't you stop her?

08:48.390 --> 08:49.270
Look, look.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.800
You promised not to get mad.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.910
Hear me out.

08:52.150 --> 08:54.270
I think Zhen is quite a good girl.

08:55.270 --> 08:56.320
She's smart,

08:56.320 --> 08:57.380
and she works hard.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.850
Just as the old sayings go,

08:59.270 --> 09:00.960
like father, like daughter;

09:00.960 --> 09:02.630
the apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

09:02.630 --> 09:03.750
I already noticed she had a talent

09:03.750 --> 09:06.000
for learning ink-making
when she was little.

09:06.000 --> 09:06.840
Cut it out.

09:07.480 --> 09:09.120
I don't care what your son does.

09:09.120 --> 09:10.240
But Zhen cannot do it.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.120
Why did you get worked up

09:11.120 --> 09:11.690
just from talking?

09:11.690 --> 09:14.090
Don't regret it
when I finish teaching her.

09:16.270 --> 09:17.200
Chen the Third,

09:17.480 --> 09:19.410
kick Zhen out of your ink workshop.

09:19.510 --> 09:21.640
Otherwise, we are no longer brothers.

09:26.270 --> 09:27.730
The young one is stubborn,

09:27.750 --> 09:29.410
but the old one is even more so.

09:31.990 --> 09:36.210
[Luo's Ink Workshop]

09:38.910 --> 09:40.510
Working anywhere is the same

09:40.750 --> 09:41.630
as long as I can make ink

09:41.630 --> 09:43.000
and learn the craft.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.120
Master Zeng,

09:45.360 --> 09:48.220
we've taken in
a new batch of apprentices recently.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.420
Please take a look.

09:50.160 --> 09:54.080
[Zeng Yipin, Ink-making Master of Luo Ink]

10:09.630 --> 10:11.490
Pounding ink requires strength.

10:14.030 --> 10:16.690
Other ink workers are
all wearing undershirts.

10:16.960 --> 10:18.490
Why aren't you wearing one?

10:19.790 --> 10:20.870
I'm not hot.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.930
So there's no need.

10:22.870 --> 10:24.400
Is it that you don't need it,

10:25.080 --> 10:26.210
or you can't wear it?

10:30.000 --> 10:31.240
I don't n-need it.

10:38.150 --> 10:38.670
You...

10:39.000 --> 10:39.910
What are you doing?

10:39.910 --> 10:41.320
So you are indeed a girl.

10:41.510 --> 10:43.000
Women cannot make ink.

10:43.120 --> 10:45.250
How dare you violate the industry rules

10:45.250 --> 10:47.580
and ruin the reputation of our Luo family?

10:48.870 --> 10:50.530
Who says women can't make ink?

10:50.630 --> 10:52.440
That's just word of mouth.

10:52.580 --> 10:53.270
Which book

10:53.290 --> 10:54.200
records a written rule,

10:54.200 --> 10:55.510
saying that women can't make ink?

10:55.510 --> 10:57.630
What a sharp-tongued girl.

10:58.000 --> 11:00.320
You broke the rules
and still talked tough.

11:00.320 --> 11:01.120
Fine.

11:01.630 --> 11:03.630
Then come with me
to the Literary Association

11:03.630 --> 11:05.160
and sort this out properly.

11:05.390 --> 11:06.200
Guards!

11:06.870 --> 11:07.670
Take this girl

11:07.670 --> 11:08.110
and come with me.

11:08.110 --> 11:09.390
What? Don't touch me!

11:10.390 --> 11:11.600
I can walk by myself!

11:19.270 --> 11:20.070
President Hu,

11:20.390 --> 11:22.550
and all the Heads of the Houses
in the ink industry,

11:22.550 --> 11:23.320
today,

11:23.440 --> 11:25.300
please judge it for my Luo family.

11:25.550 --> 11:27.320
This girl disguised herself as a man

11:27.320 --> 11:28.960
and snuck into the Luo's Ink Workshop.

11:28.960 --> 11:30.240
She ruined the family's tradition

11:30.240 --> 11:32.750
and disgraced the industry.

11:33.670 --> 11:35.390
-This is outrageous.
-What a shame.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.750
I only found out today

11:37.080 --> 11:38.280
that you, Zeng Yipin,

11:38.440 --> 11:41.200
can already represent the Luo family
to handle things.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.400
Eldest Young Master,

11:42.870 --> 11:44.800
I have worked for Luo Ink for years,

11:44.910 --> 11:47.380
so, of course, I share the honor
and disgrace of the Luo family.

11:47.380 --> 11:49.040
Share the honor and disgrace?

11:50.790 --> 11:51.720
Li Zhen!

11:52.150 --> 11:53.510
You are a woman.

11:53.510 --> 11:55.710
How could you disguise yourself as a man

11:55.790 --> 11:56.870
and sneak into the ink workshop?

11:56.870 --> 11:58.120
How inappropriate!

11:58.270 --> 12:00.730
You've been such a disgrace
to the Li family!

12:00.840 --> 12:03.320
Uncle Jingdong, you really are forgetful.

12:03.630 --> 12:05.320
I've long been expelled from the clan.

12:05.320 --> 12:06.580
Even if I'm a disgrace,

12:06.750 --> 12:09.080
what does it have to do
with your Li family?

12:09.240 --> 12:09.960
Enough.

12:10.720 --> 12:13.390
Since you are here
at the Literary Association to argue,

12:13.390 --> 12:14.440
the Literary Association

12:14.440 --> 12:16.910
will help you settle this.

12:17.080 --> 12:17.910
President Hu,

12:18.550 --> 12:19.840
our Huizhou ink industry

12:19.840 --> 12:22.320
has always had a rule
that women cannot make ink.

12:22.320 --> 12:24.870
That is merely an old cliche
passed down by word of mouth,

12:24.870 --> 12:26.670
but not a written conclusion.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.880
How can it serve as a constraint?

12:29.510 --> 12:30.600
I've heard

12:30.870 --> 12:33.270
that Aunt Luo Mengzhen
of the Luo family had astonishing talent

12:33.270 --> 12:34.480
in ink-making.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.790
The ink-blending technique

12:36.790 --> 12:38.720
still used by Luo Ink today was

12:38.790 --> 12:40.630
just invented by Aunt Luo.

12:41.120 --> 12:43.250
I have a question for you, Master Zeng.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.240
Since you've worked
for Luo Ink for so many years,

12:45.240 --> 12:46.390
have you ever used

12:46.390 --> 12:48.270
the Luo family's ink-blending technique?

12:48.270 --> 12:48.670
Well...

12:48.670 --> 12:49.930
Since you have used it,

12:50.200 --> 12:52.080
using a technique created by a woman

12:52.080 --> 12:53.240
while blatantly

12:53.240 --> 12:55.440
claiming that women cannot make ink

12:56.630 --> 12:58.150
is truly contradictory

12:58.510 --> 12:59.600
and ungrateful.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.440
Miss Li, I know you are

13:04.440 --> 13:06.360
an expert at identifying pine and ink.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.720
Not until today did I learn

13:07.720 --> 13:09.850
that you're also this sharp-tongued.

13:11.390 --> 13:13.120
That "ungrateful" comment

13:14.480 --> 13:15.790
was really well said.

13:17.000 --> 13:17.870
I think

13:19.230 --> 13:20.080
ink-making

13:21.020 --> 13:22.450
is about talent.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.910
As long as one can make good ink,

13:26.030 --> 13:27.870
who cares if it's a man or a woman,

13:27.870 --> 13:29.320
a person or a dog?

13:29.440 --> 13:32.600
Every family has its rules,
and every trade has its regulations.

13:32.600 --> 13:35.390
If even random nobodies could make ink,

13:35.480 --> 13:37.660
wouldn't our Huizhou ink industry
be turned upside down?

13:37.660 --> 13:40.060
Are you worried that you lack talent

13:40.080 --> 13:42.440
and can't even beat
these "random nobodies"?

13:42.440 --> 13:44.510
Eldest Young Master Luo,
please mind your words.

13:44.510 --> 13:46.240
How can you compare me to her?

13:46.440 --> 13:48.320
I am the orthodox ink-maker!

13:48.320 --> 13:49.450
What is "orthodox"?

13:49.910 --> 13:52.030
Making good ink is orthodox.

13:52.030 --> 13:53.120
Failing to make good ink

13:53.120 --> 13:55.120
is disappointing one's ancestors!

13:57.910 --> 13:58.630
You.

13:59.720 --> 14:00.480
Tell me

14:00.910 --> 14:02.840
how the ink made by Miss Li is.

14:03.440 --> 14:04.640
Eldest Young Master,

14:05.270 --> 14:06.150
I heard

14:07.180 --> 14:09.780
that she did learn
how to melt glue pretty well.

14:11.270 --> 14:12.200
That's an honest comment.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.240
Miss Li

14:13.630 --> 14:15.630
also came to the Pan's Ink Workshop.

14:15.790 --> 14:17.000
The master said

14:16.040 --> 14:20.360
[Pan Yongnian, Manager of the Pan family]

14:17.790 --> 14:20.250
she was not very good
at woodblock printing,

14:21.200 --> 14:22.730
but she worked really hard.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.030
Miss Li,

14:25.270 --> 14:27.600
please stretch out your left hand.

14:29.960 --> 14:30.510
It's fine.

14:30.510 --> 14:31.910
Just show them.

14:36.670 --> 14:38.120
Open it and hold it high.

14:39.480 --> 14:40.320
Higher.

14:44.630 --> 14:46.960
Everyone here is an expert in ink-making.

14:47.390 --> 14:48.440
If you want to know whether a person

14:48.440 --> 14:51.000
is truly sincere about ink
or just faking it,

14:51.030 --> 14:52.630
it's all in their hands.

14:52.630 --> 14:54.080
Look carefully!

14:56.130 --> 14:59.450
I guess you've been rich for so long

14:59.500 --> 15:01.370
that your hands have been blessed,

15:01.370 --> 15:02.570
lost their calluses,

15:02.750 --> 15:04.550
and grown new flesh, huh?

15:25.000 --> 15:27.960
Since Eldest Young Master Luo said so,

15:28.550 --> 15:30.950
if I stick to the word of mouth that women

15:30.980 --> 15:32.150
cannot make ink,

15:32.270 --> 15:35.670
wouldn't I seem pedantic?

15:36.270 --> 15:37.390
It's just that

15:38.550 --> 15:41.720
our ink industry only passes skills
to men, not women.

15:42.750 --> 15:46.600
This is actually because women
will eventually marry someone,

15:47.000 --> 15:50.530
and the ink recipe cannot
fall into the hands of other families.

15:50.840 --> 15:51.750
Previously,

15:52.000 --> 15:54.510
the Li family's ink recipe was
almost leaked.

15:54.510 --> 15:57.510
Regarding Miss Li Zhen
breaking off her engagement in public,

15:57.510 --> 15:58.360
I suppose

15:59.000 --> 15:59.750
you all

15:59.790 --> 16:00.790
know it.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.440
President Hu,

16:02.870 --> 16:04.130
my learning to make ink

16:04.150 --> 16:05.750
has nothing to do with Li Ink.

16:05.840 --> 16:07.770
How could the ink recipe be leaked?

16:08.200 --> 16:10.150
If anyone here is worried,

16:10.240 --> 16:11.500
I can just swear an oath

16:11.870 --> 16:13.270
that I will never marry anyone.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.000
Well...

16:14.850 --> 16:15.660
Miss Li,

16:15.760 --> 16:17.290
it is wrong for you to say so.

16:17.670 --> 16:18.550
If so,

16:19.030 --> 16:20.000
Eighth Master Li

16:20.200 --> 16:22.080
will definitely blame us.

16:25.630 --> 16:26.550
Third Master.

16:27.030 --> 16:27.830
Third Master.

16:39.510 --> 16:40.360
Everyone,

16:41.390 --> 16:42.510
after all,

16:42.960 --> 16:46.420
Li the Eighth is the head
of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters.

16:47.670 --> 16:49.600
He has contributed a lot to Hui Ink.

16:50.910 --> 16:53.640
Even though he has quit
mading ink for a long time,

16:54.000 --> 16:56.330
we shouldn't forget what he's done for us.

16:58.800 --> 16:59.640
Today,

16:59.660 --> 17:03.060
if we make things difficult
for his granddaughter like this,

17:03.440 --> 17:05.000
I think everyone here

17:05.720 --> 17:07.400
would feel bad about it.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.550
Why don't we just

17:10.109 --> 17:12.270
give Miss Li Zhen a chance?

17:13.310 --> 17:15.589
She has learned to make ink for a while.

17:16.589 --> 17:19.030
We might as well let her
make an ink stick.

17:19.079 --> 17:19.650
Well...

17:20.790 --> 17:21.720
Then,

17:22.310 --> 17:23.720
we can all

17:23.750 --> 17:25.880
take a look and evaluate it together.

17:26.589 --> 17:28.310
If Miss Li Zhen

17:28.510 --> 17:30.440
truly has a gift for making ink,

17:31.830 --> 17:32.760
the ink industry

17:33.590 --> 17:35.790
should not let such a talent go to waste.

17:37.270 --> 17:38.070
Third Master,

17:38.110 --> 17:39.350
you've got a point.

17:45.590 --> 17:46.440
Miss Li Zhen,

17:47.240 --> 17:48.200
do you accept it?

18:02.920 --> 18:04.580
She disguised herself as a man

18:04.790 --> 18:06.480
to sneak into various major ink workshops.

18:06.480 --> 18:07.790
How shameful!

18:08.590 --> 18:09.680
As her older brother,

18:09.680 --> 18:11.000
why didn't you stop her?

18:11.000 --> 18:11.400
You...

18:11.920 --> 18:13.400
You've really grown some nerve!

18:13.400 --> 18:15.550
You're getting bolder and bolder!

18:18.110 --> 18:19.770
You're really pissing me off!

18:22.110 --> 18:23.160
Zhen did that

18:23.350 --> 18:25.200
to learn ink-making and earn more money

18:25.200 --> 18:26.460
to support our family.

18:26.690 --> 18:29.690
Our family doesn't need to rely on her
to make a living!

18:34.110 --> 18:34.920
Mother,

18:35.240 --> 18:36.750
just let Zhen do it.

18:37.440 --> 18:39.110
If she really fails in the end,

18:39.640 --> 18:41.000
she won't blame us.

18:41.550 --> 18:43.350
If we stop her,

18:43.960 --> 18:45.030
and she gets angry,

18:45.510 --> 18:47.550
who knows what she will do?

18:47.920 --> 18:49.320
That would be even worse.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.720
This girl

18:52.720 --> 18:54.350
from the Li family

18:54.920 --> 18:56.550
actually had no shame

18:57.070 --> 18:59.160
and went to work at an ink workshop!

18:59.400 --> 19:00.880
She made such a big scene,

19:01.030 --> 19:02.960
causing all my peers to laugh at me.

19:05.790 --> 19:06.590
Ronghua.

19:08.960 --> 19:09.820
Come down here.

19:10.270 --> 19:11.870
I have something to tell you.

19:17.830 --> 19:18.550
Sit down.

19:21.920 --> 19:22.680
Ronghua,

19:23.200 --> 19:24.070
from now on,

19:24.440 --> 19:26.590
don't get mixed up with that crazy girl
from the Li family

19:26.590 --> 19:27.550
anymore.

19:27.640 --> 19:28.920
A woman's reputation

19:29.000 --> 19:30.070
matters so much!

19:30.240 --> 19:31.000
Besides,

19:31.440 --> 19:32.310
I

19:33.050 --> 19:34.680
have arranged a marriage for you.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.680
Just stay at home.

19:37.400 --> 19:38.400
Don't ruin it

19:38.480 --> 19:39.830
because of her.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.830
Marriage?

19:43.240 --> 19:44.030
Father,

19:44.440 --> 19:45.270
Mother,

19:46.270 --> 19:48.310
w-why didn't I know about this engagement?

19:48.310 --> 19:49.920
It's just right that you don't know.

19:49.920 --> 19:50.920
Since ancient times,

19:50.920 --> 19:52.160
children's marriages

19:52.160 --> 19:53.090
have always been

19:53.160 --> 19:54.110
determined by their parents

19:54.110 --> 19:55.440
and matchmakers.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.680
For Eldest Young Master Luo

19:56.680 --> 19:58.400
becoming related
with our Tian family by marriage,

19:58.400 --> 20:00.750
we are already climbing above our station.

20:00.750 --> 20:02.400
You should be happy about it.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.270
Father,

20:03.480 --> 20:04.030
well,

20:04.070 --> 20:05.830
you know Eldest Young Master Luo's temper

20:05.830 --> 20:07.070
better than I do.

20:07.070 --> 20:07.830
Besides...

20:08.070 --> 20:10.510
Besides, he already had a wife
and concubines.

20:10.510 --> 20:11.750
I don't want to marry him.

20:11.750 --> 20:13.680
You have to marry him
whether you want to or not.

20:13.680 --> 20:14.440
Look,

20:14.880 --> 20:16.230
just because she's spent too much time

20:16.230 --> 20:17.510
with that girl from the Li family,

20:17.510 --> 20:18.720
now she can even say such words

20:18.720 --> 20:19.980
against filial piety.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.310
Mother,

20:23.830 --> 20:25.720
I don't want to leave you and Father yet.

20:25.720 --> 20:28.590
Besides, I've never spent time
with Eldest Young Master Luo.

20:28.590 --> 20:29.790
I don't want to leave my fate

20:29.790 --> 20:31.720
in the hands of a stranger like him.

20:34.350 --> 20:35.350
Did you hear that?

20:35.640 --> 20:36.960
What on earth were you saying?

20:36.960 --> 20:38.790
Why are you
throwing such a temper tantrum?

20:38.790 --> 20:39.750
If you have something to say,

20:39.750 --> 20:40.680
talk to her nicely.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.960
She will understand.

20:42.110 --> 20:42.880
Shut up.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.000
All you do is spoil the children.

20:45.160 --> 20:47.420
Look at the 3 children of our Tian family.

20:47.640 --> 20:49.440
Each of them is a hard nut to crack.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.830
This matter is settled, then.

20:50.830 --> 20:52.270
For the sake of our Tian family,

20:52.270 --> 20:53.870
just be good and stay at home.

20:54.350 --> 20:56.550
If you dare to have thoughts
like Li Zhen's

20:56.550 --> 20:58.160
and want to call off the engagement,

20:58.160 --> 20:59.590
I'll break your legs!

20:59.830 --> 21:00.350
Master.

21:00.350 --> 21:02.080
A bunch of goof-got-nothings.

21:10.030 --> 21:12.630
Ronghua, how do you have time
to visit me today?

21:14.960 --> 21:15.920
Zhen,

21:17.110 --> 21:18.840
my marriage has been arranged.

21:19.000 --> 21:21.790
That's a good thing
to have your marriage arranged!

21:21.790 --> 21:24.350
Which young master is so lucky?

21:27.240 --> 21:28.640
It's...

21:28.920 --> 21:30.320
Eldest Young Master Luo.

21:33.480 --> 21:34.480
Luo Wensong?

21:38.830 --> 21:39.440
He is

21:39.790 --> 21:41.110
so old

21:41.550 --> 21:43.550
and also eccentric in personality.

21:43.790 --> 21:44.640
Besides,

21:45.790 --> 21:47.270
he is taking a second wife.

21:48.590 --> 21:50.590
The Luo family is so prominent.

21:50.790 --> 21:52.160
Many girls would be

21:52.270 --> 21:54.200
willing even to be his second wife.

21:56.030 --> 21:57.110
Speaking of this,

21:57.490 --> 22:01.420
it's me who climbs above my station,
marrying Eldest Young Master Luo.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.830
My father said that,

22:02.960 --> 22:03.880
in a few days,

22:04.030 --> 22:05.830
he will go dig a well for the Luo family.

22:05.550 --> 22:07.480
[Cave Digging:
In Huizhou, before a girl gets married,]

22:07.480 --> 22:09.410
[her natal family should go
to dig a well in her husband's house,]

22:09.410 --> 22:11.340
[implying that after marriage,
her natal family will cover her expenses.]

22:09.790 --> 22:10.480
Ronghua,

22:11.340 --> 22:13.280
[This is the marriage tradition
in ancient Huizhou.]

22:11.400 --> 22:12.480
do you

22:12.550 --> 22:14.270
like Eldest Young Master Luo?

22:18.000 --> 22:20.400
Marriages are decided
by parents and matchmakers.

22:20.400 --> 22:21.730
Whether I like him or not

22:21.790 --> 22:22.750
doesn't matter.

22:27.160 --> 22:27.880
Alright.

22:28.350 --> 22:29.110
They say

22:29.110 --> 22:30.790
older men are more caring.

22:31.000 --> 22:31.830
Perhaps

22:31.880 --> 22:33.550
it'll be a good marriage.

22:36.640 --> 22:37.700
Enough about this.

22:37.830 --> 22:38.640
Zhen,

22:38.830 --> 22:39.880
I came today

22:39.960 --> 22:41.270
to give you something.

22:42.160 --> 22:43.240
What is this?

22:44.880 --> 22:46.110
Zhen, I know

22:46.400 --> 22:47.940
you will need these since you've

22:47.940 --> 22:49.670
started learning ink-making.

22:50.160 --> 22:50.920
I took these

22:50.920 --> 22:52.790
from my family's ink workshop.

22:52.880 --> 22:53.830
Use them for now.

22:53.830 --> 22:55.400
Otherwise, you'd have to buy them.

22:55.400 --> 22:56.070
Ronghua,

22:56.110 --> 22:58.720
these gold foil
and pearls are way too precious.

22:58.720 --> 22:59.720
I can't take them.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.440
If your family finds out,

23:02.160 --> 23:04.020
you'll be in trouble, I'm afraid.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.160
Don't worry.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.260
I didn't take much.

23:06.260 --> 23:07.220
It's fine.

23:09.830 --> 23:11.310
Take them,

23:11.680 --> 23:12.640
and consider

23:12.830 --> 23:14.030
that I, Tian Ronghua,

23:14.400 --> 23:16.400
contribute a bit to the ink you make.

23:16.550 --> 23:17.790
From now on,

23:18.200 --> 23:19.720
you can help me do the things

23:19.720 --> 23:20.790
that I can't do.

23:47.200 --> 23:47.880
Father,

23:48.550 --> 23:51.830
thanks to Third Grandfather Chen
for lending me his ink workshop,

23:51.830 --> 23:53.920
I spent quite a lot of time

23:54.200 --> 23:56.000
managing to make this only piece

23:56.070 --> 23:58.000
of fairly good-quality ink stick.

23:58.550 --> 23:59.160
Father,

23:59.830 --> 24:02.630
you must bless me to succeed
in the ink assessment.

24:19.830 --> 24:21.070
The ink is grayish,

24:21.920 --> 24:23.380
and it feels too sluggish.

24:26.640 --> 24:28.200
It's still not good enough.

24:29.440 --> 24:31.240
What exactly went wrong here?

24:36.440 --> 24:37.440
Show me

24:37.640 --> 24:39.200
what kind of ink you made.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.000
Don't look.

24:42.270 --> 24:44.070
The ink hasn't even taken shape.

24:45.420 --> 24:48.480
Then what kind of ink is considered
to have taken shape?

24:49.000 --> 24:51.400
Of course, it requires precious materials

24:51.480 --> 24:53.080
and skilled craftsmanship.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.200
When writing,

24:54.750 --> 24:56.850
it should be as smooth
as floating clouds and flying dragons.

24:56.850 --> 24:58.920
I don't understand
any of what you're saying.

24:58.920 --> 25:00.590
Anyway, your father said that,

25:00.590 --> 25:03.310
no matter how beautiful
the ink stick looks on the outside,

25:03.310 --> 25:05.680
or how precious the materials
it's made from,

25:05.680 --> 25:07.880
it is ultimately made for people to use.

25:08.310 --> 25:09.750
So, who uses ink

25:09.920 --> 25:11.520
and what kind of ink they need

25:12.000 --> 25:14.000
are not as complicated as you think.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.360
Just make an ink stick

25:16.680 --> 25:18.720
that is comfortable and handy to use.

25:18.720 --> 25:19.780
Isn't that enough?

25:28.030 --> 25:28.830
Mother,

25:29.550 --> 25:30.880
you really know a lot.

25:31.160 --> 25:32.350
I don't know much.

25:32.350 --> 25:34.080
It's all what your father said.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.200
Eat slowly.

25:37.200 --> 25:37.960
Slowly.

25:38.640 --> 25:40.000
I'm going out for a bit.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.590
Where are you going now?

25:52.070 --> 25:53.510
Come on, madam, take a look at our ink.

25:53.510 --> 25:54.000
Wen.

25:54.000 --> 25:54.590
It's nice and affordable.

25:54.590 --> 25:55.960
I've seen you come here so often

25:55.960 --> 25:57.000
to buy ink for your son.

25:57.000 --> 25:58.200
Why don't you go over there

25:58.200 --> 25:59.310
to buy a good piece?

26:01.110 --> 26:02.920
It's just that my son uses a lot of ink

26:02.920 --> 26:04.310
when he practices writing.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.310
Our family

26:05.550 --> 26:07.700
can't afford to always use good ink.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.480
President Hu,

26:26.920 --> 26:28.550
all the Heads of the Houses
in the ink industry,

26:28.550 --> 26:30.880
this is the Original Intention Ink I made.

26:31.610 --> 26:33.000
One look at this ink,

26:33.050 --> 26:35.270
and you just know
the lampblack was over-burned.

26:35.270 --> 26:37.070
The pounding was also inadequate.

26:37.070 --> 26:39.350
It was made very carelessly.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.270
Indeed.

26:40.510 --> 26:42.750
This ink
neither looks like commercial goods

26:42.750 --> 26:43.960
of high prices,

26:44.370 --> 26:46.350
nor does it have the qualities
of ink to be treasured as an heirloom.

26:46.350 --> 26:48.240
Its production is very ordinary.

26:48.510 --> 26:50.420
In Huizhou, where good ink abounds,

26:50.420 --> 26:52.920
it's really not worth being presented
in public.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.590
Shoddy workmanship!

26:55.510 --> 26:57.000
If I made this ink,

26:57.480 --> 27:01.790
I would be even too embarrassed to enter
the gate of the Literary Association.

27:01.790 --> 27:02.960
I thought

27:03.750 --> 27:06.080
you would ask
Eighth Master Li to help you.

27:07.160 --> 27:07.960
President Hu,

27:08.590 --> 27:11.440
come on, please evaluate this ink.

27:12.180 --> 27:13.590
Having such courage

27:13.640 --> 27:15.510
and showing such sincerity

27:16.540 --> 27:18.600
actually make me think highly of you.

27:21.920 --> 27:23.520
The materials are ordinary,

27:24.310 --> 27:26.110
and the craftsmanship is rough.

27:26.310 --> 27:29.070
It can only be considered a low-grade ink.

27:30.400 --> 27:33.240
It seems that Miss Li Zhen can only...

27:35.680 --> 27:36.550
President Hu,

27:38.080 --> 27:39.630
I gave Zhen the task.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.510
Why

27:40.920 --> 27:42.520
didn't you even show it to me?

27:44.240 --> 27:45.770
Here you are, Third Master.

28:00.350 --> 28:01.240
Zhenniang.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.790
Tell me

28:03.480 --> 28:06.920
why you made an ink stick
with such a simple recipe?

28:07.550 --> 28:10.030
You must have known before making it

28:10.350 --> 28:11.440
that such ink

28:11.750 --> 28:14.880
would not impress the seniors
in the ink trade.

28:15.310 --> 28:16.230
Yes, I know.

28:18.030 --> 28:20.560
Because I couldn't make ink
of better quality

28:20.920 --> 28:22.780
or a more complicated technique.

28:23.550 --> 28:24.400
This is the best ink

28:24.400 --> 28:26.480
I can make for now.

28:26.720 --> 28:29.720
I also thought about
adding precious materials,

28:30.390 --> 28:32.850
but I couldn't blend the ink,
no matter what.

28:33.160 --> 28:34.110
I couldn't meet higher standards,

28:34.110 --> 28:35.160
so I thought

28:35.640 --> 28:37.590
making a simple and useful ink

28:37.590 --> 28:39.050
would also be worthwhile.

28:41.510 --> 28:43.240
This is my original intention.

28:45.160 --> 28:48.440
How could you be so shameless,
directly saying that you couldn't make it?

28:48.440 --> 28:49.970
And "original intention"?

28:50.510 --> 28:52.790
You are just embarrassing yourself!

28:53.160 --> 28:54.560
My abilities fall short.

28:55.110 --> 28:56.000
I admit it.

28:56.310 --> 28:57.260
Everyone here

28:57.480 --> 28:59.160
is a senior in the ink industry.

28:59.160 --> 29:01.790
It's understandable
that you don't think much of this ink.

29:01.790 --> 29:03.070
But to me,

29:03.110 --> 29:04.480
I have done my best.

29:04.510 --> 29:06.480
I can say I have no regret.

29:07.920 --> 29:10.000
Although this ink is of inferior quality,

29:10.000 --> 29:12.110
it has the advantages of being dark enough

29:12.110 --> 29:13.640
and being cheap to produce.

29:13.790 --> 29:14.720
Whether

29:14.750 --> 29:16.310
for keeping accounts in workshops

29:16.310 --> 29:18.070
or for children practicing writing,

29:18.070 --> 29:20.000
it might as well be a better choice.

29:21.000 --> 29:22.070
In this regard,

29:22.880 --> 29:23.830
I believe

29:24.270 --> 29:26.160
I haven't
gone against my original intention,

29:26.160 --> 29:28.200
so I have no regrets.

29:36.880 --> 29:39.000
Now that I know the result today,

29:43.440 --> 29:45.750
I'd like to ask Third Grandfather
to give this ink

29:45.750 --> 29:47.440
to someone who needs it as a gift,

29:47.440 --> 29:49.160
so it will fulfill its value.

31:08.750 --> 31:09.750
It's dark enough.

31:10.350 --> 31:11.920
It's a piece of good ink.

31:12.030 --> 31:13.160
Good ink?

31:13.680 --> 31:15.030
Eldest Young Master Luo,

31:15.030 --> 31:16.720
are you out of your mind?

31:16.720 --> 31:18.920
That is an inferior ink,

31:19.070 --> 31:20.960
and you call it good?

31:22.510 --> 31:24.550
Everything has its suitable function;

31:24.550 --> 31:26.440
materials have their uses;

31:26.750 --> 31:30.410
everything in its right place,
so there is nothing else to be done.

31:30.510 --> 31:32.240
Miss Li Zhen said earlier

31:32.240 --> 31:34.240
that this ink is cheap

31:34.240 --> 31:38.400
and suitable
for accounting and children's writing.

31:39.230 --> 31:40.800
Everyone,

31:41.510 --> 31:43.840
when you first learned to write
as a child,

31:43.880 --> 31:46.310
if given a piece of top-quality ink,

31:47.640 --> 31:49.300
would you be willing to use it?

31:52.400 --> 31:53.960
When our ancestors made

31:53.960 --> 31:55.240
the first piece of ink,

31:55.240 --> 31:58.030
it was to write down
their thoughts and feelings.

31:58.400 --> 32:00.480
How could there be so many rules?

32:00.510 --> 32:03.400
But nothing can be accomplished
without rules.

32:03.590 --> 32:06.520
Without rules, how can we determine
superiority and inferiority?

32:06.520 --> 32:08.200
If we don't tell between good and bad,

32:08.200 --> 32:09.350
what's the point of having

32:09.350 --> 32:10.640
our ink workshops,

32:10.680 --> 32:11.880
having us, and having

32:11.880 --> 32:13.160
this Literary Association?

32:13.160 --> 32:14.960
Hui Ink has been passed down
to the present.

32:14.960 --> 32:17.440
Huizhou ink workshops are ubiquitous.

32:18.250 --> 32:20.410
Aren't we all striving

32:20.440 --> 32:22.440
for perfection?

32:22.640 --> 32:23.200
Yes.

32:23.200 --> 32:26.460
Striving for perfection is
the foundation of ink-making.

32:26.830 --> 32:29.200
I asked the manager of the ink workshop.

32:29.530 --> 32:32.560
He said Miss Li Zhen started learning
ink-making at the ink workshop

32:32.560 --> 32:34.360
only 3 to 5 months ago.

32:34.550 --> 32:36.440
I have a question for you all.

32:36.440 --> 32:38.240
When you had just learned ink-making
for a few months,

32:38.240 --> 32:40.400
could you make

32:40.480 --> 32:42.790
the inferior ink you said?

32:46.200 --> 32:47.070
Yes.

32:51.270 --> 32:54.270
Wensong's words remind me

32:54.480 --> 32:56.740
of when I first entered the ink industry.

32:57.830 --> 33:00.430
Not until I had learned
ink-making for 2 years,

33:00.550 --> 33:01.790
I mean, 2 whole years,

33:02.770 --> 33:04.770
did I make my very first piece of ink.

33:04.960 --> 33:06.480
As for its quality,

33:09.200 --> 33:10.510
it was nothing special.

33:10.510 --> 33:11.960
That being the case,

33:12.920 --> 33:16.160
Miss Li Zhen's ink

33:16.400 --> 33:19.680
must be considered
a piece of good ink for now.

33:20.440 --> 33:22.840
You all have been making ink
for a long time.

33:23.200 --> 33:25.460
Do not forget your original intentions.

33:27.590 --> 33:28.590
Besides,

33:30.030 --> 33:32.310
it's none of your business
whether Miss Li Zhen

33:32.310 --> 33:34.030
makes ink or not.

33:34.720 --> 33:36.070
If I were Miss Li Zhen,

33:36.070 --> 33:39.000
I wouldn't have even bothered
to take this test.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.960
I'd make my own ink.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.680
Why care so much?

33:42.700 --> 33:44.950
You are trying everything to stop her

33:45.240 --> 33:47.240
because you are afraid.

33:47.440 --> 33:48.920
You're afraid that one day,

33:48.920 --> 33:51.400
Miss Li Zhen might
become a master ink-maker

33:51.480 --> 33:54.590
and surpass all of you as a woman,

33:54.590 --> 33:56.160
making you lose face.

33:56.440 --> 33:59.440
You think we'd be afraid of a callow girl?

33:59.480 --> 34:00.550
Ridiculous!

34:02.750 --> 34:04.270
In this case,

34:07.510 --> 34:10.320
there's no need to discuss this further.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.550
Did Zhen really say that?

34:18.920 --> 34:20.030
Word for word.

34:23.800 --> 34:25.190
At her age,

34:25.480 --> 34:26.880
her understanding of ink

34:26.920 --> 34:27.780
is probably...

34:28.030 --> 34:30.560
It's probably even better
than yours or mine.

34:35.480 --> 34:37.280
She asked me to give the ink away.

34:39.550 --> 34:41.550
After careful consideration, I think

34:41.550 --> 34:43.409
the one who needs it most right now

34:44.590 --> 34:46.510
is probably you, Li the Eighth.

34:55.670 --> 34:56.510
Jinshui,

34:57.360 --> 34:59.220
just take her as your apprentice.

35:11.880 --> 35:12.590
Yes,

35:13.550 --> 35:15.110
I know you follow the rules.

35:16.590 --> 35:17.960
You made a vow

35:18.070 --> 35:19.600
that you wouldn't make ink.

35:20.360 --> 35:23.260
But no one ever said that you couldn't
teach others to make ink.

35:23.260 --> 35:25.630
The Literary Association "sealed"
your ink-making hands,

35:25.630 --> 35:26.880
but not your mouth.

35:27.030 --> 35:28.360
Can't you even talk?

35:33.110 --> 35:34.400
Li the Eighth!

35:35.550 --> 35:37.010
Zhen is such a good talent!

35:37.480 --> 35:38.920
What's the harm
in taking her as your apprentice?

35:38.920 --> 35:40.190
Forget the rule of passing it to men
but not women.

35:40.190 --> 35:42.000
Even the Literary Association
has tacitly allowed it!

35:42.000 --> 35:43.630
Jinshui, I'm telling you.

35:43.760 --> 35:45.840
You don't even know how lucky you are!

35:45.960 --> 35:48.320
If Junshan had half of Zhen's talent,

35:48.360 --> 35:49.920
if I had such a brilliant granddaughter,

35:49.920 --> 35:52.630
I'd be willing to stop making ink
for the rest of my life!

35:52.630 --> 35:53.320
Also,

35:54.710 --> 35:56.280
don't you want Li Ink

35:56.920 --> 35:58.880
to have an inheritor?

36:02.190 --> 36:03.550
That's all I want to say.

36:04.360 --> 36:06.230
Think it over yourself.

36:06.230 --> 36:07.670
You stubborn man!

36:17.070 --> 36:17.960
Jingfu.

36:18.840 --> 36:25.110
[Li Jingfu's Tomb]

36:19.150 --> 36:20.510
I'm here to visit you.

36:31.510 --> 36:32.590
This is

36:33.670 --> 36:35.440
the very first ink

36:37.960 --> 36:39.510
your daughter, Zhen, made.

36:41.960 --> 36:42.800
Look,

36:43.800 --> 36:46.000
it's called "Original Intention Ink."

36:48.280 --> 36:50.540
I swore before the Literary Association

36:51.230 --> 36:52.800
that I would never

36:54.230 --> 36:55.590
make ink again.

36:58.670 --> 37:00.630
I have left the ink industry.

37:02.800 --> 37:03.880
But now,

37:06.000 --> 37:07.800
Zhen wants to learn ink-making.

37:10.150 --> 37:11.840
What do you think I should do?

37:24.030 --> 37:24.920
Mother!

37:25.970 --> 37:27.490
Mother, look who's here.

37:34.230 --> 37:35.400
Jinshui.

37:36.800 --> 37:38.200
Seventh Sister-in-law.

37:47.590 --> 37:50.360
Jinshui, what are you doing?

37:55.320 --> 37:56.800
My first kowtow

37:57.190 --> 37:58.230
is for

37:58.840 --> 38:00.480
the ink recipe incident.

38:03.110 --> 38:04.880
I failed your trust, Rujun,

38:05.630 --> 38:06.630
and I am truly

38:07.440 --> 38:08.800
a sinner to Li Ink.

38:17.550 --> 38:18.590
The second kowtow

38:19.590 --> 38:21.360
is for the appreciation

38:22.190 --> 38:24.120
Seventh Brother and you showed me.

38:24.320 --> 38:27.000
I was born in the family's side branch,

38:27.480 --> 38:28.940
with both my parents dead.

38:30.320 --> 38:32.320
Thanks to Seventh Brother, Jingqi,

38:32.400 --> 38:34.930
who strongly recommended me
to the Old Master

38:35.110 --> 38:37.240
and led me into the path of ink-making,

38:37.480 --> 38:39.190
and thanks to you, who always

38:39.670 --> 38:41.400
looked after me like a mother,

38:41.840 --> 38:43.880
I made those achievements later.

38:44.360 --> 38:45.590
I can't

38:46.510 --> 38:47.570
pay you back enough

38:48.710 --> 38:50.150
for this kindness.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.710
Jinshui,

38:52.960 --> 38:54.880
these are all in the past.

38:55.280 --> 38:56.680
Let's leave them behind.

38:58.550 --> 38:59.800
This third kowtow

39:00.030 --> 39:01.760
is for my granddaughter, Zhen.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.400
Rujun,

39:11.070 --> 39:13.590
I once thought Zhen wanted
to learn ink-making

39:13.590 --> 39:15.150
out of momentary anger.

39:16.510 --> 39:17.640
And I didn't want her

39:18.390 --> 39:20.420
to suffer from the smoke and fire.

39:21.280 --> 39:22.410
I didn't expect Zhen

39:22.840 --> 39:26.570
to be genuinely devoted to it,
sticking to her original intention.

39:27.440 --> 39:29.960
Today, I'd like to plead with you, Rujun,

39:31.320 --> 39:33.480
to allow me to teach Zhen ink-making.

39:36.710 --> 39:38.920
There is no need to plead with me.

39:40.400 --> 39:42.710
I've been waiting for you to say this

39:43.460 --> 39:45.450
for ages.

39:46.760 --> 39:49.510
Jinshui, get up. Get up.

39:53.880 --> 39:55.320
Jinshui.

39:57.320 --> 39:59.550
Zhen is gifted

40:00.510 --> 40:02.280
just as you are.

40:04.320 --> 40:05.980
If her talent were to be buried

40:06.110 --> 40:08.630
merely because she is a girl,

40:10.320 --> 40:12.710
wouldn't it be a great pity?

40:14.590 --> 40:16.280
You have my approval.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.280
Thank you, Rujun.

40:25.480 --> 40:27.670
Father, I tried my best.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.200
But I don't regret it.

40:29.440 --> 40:30.320
From now on,

40:30.510 --> 40:32.190
no matter what obstacles lie ahead,

40:32.190 --> 40:34.280
I will never give up on ink-making.

40:34.920 --> 40:36.230
Since I can't learn in the ink workshops,

40:36.230 --> 40:38.160
I'll buy books and learn by myself.

40:38.400 --> 40:39.600
Don't worry, Father.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.890
I will definitely work hard

40:42.110 --> 40:44.040
to make our family live a good life.

40:44.960 --> 40:45.710
Zhen.

41:00.710 --> 41:01.550
Grandfather,

41:01.880 --> 41:03.000
what are you doing?

41:07.840 --> 41:08.630
Zhen,

41:10.040 --> 41:10.900
come over here.

41:18.030 --> 41:19.430
The path of ink-making is

41:20.510 --> 41:22.370
full of hardships and obstacles.

41:23.670 --> 41:25.280
Can you endure them?

41:29.550 --> 41:31.410
I'm willing to endure hardships!

41:35.760 --> 41:36.510
Good.

41:42.190 --> 41:43.760
Founding Master above,

41:44.280 --> 41:47.010
I, Li Jinshui, inheritor
of the Li's Ink-making,

41:48.360 --> 41:49.840
from this moment on,

41:51.280 --> 41:52.590
take Li Zhen

41:53.400 --> 41:54.840
as my apprentice.

41:56.370 --> 41:59.080
I will pass on
the art of ink-making to her.

42:00.480 --> 42:03.590
May you bless her ink-learning journey

42:05.320 --> 42:06.920
to be smooth and successful,

42:08.710 --> 42:10.030
fulfilling her original intention.
